DTEND:20261008T040000Z
UID:lugen-uber-meine-mutter-55102@pathe.ch
DESCRIPTION:The story tells of growing up in provincial West Germany in th
 e 1980s\, in a family where one subject dominates everything: the mother's
  body weight. Is this beautiful\, strong-willed\, unpredictable woman too 
 big? Does she really need to lose weight? Yes\, she does. Decides her husb
 and\, who is increasingly dominated by the obsession that his wife's overw
 eight is responsible for everything he is being denied: the promotion\, th
 e social ascent\, the approval in the village community. And the mother is
  exposed to this\, day after day.<br/>
